      "widgets_values": [
        "A man, mid to late 30s with short hair, black, and brown eyes. He is wearing a white shirt.\n\nSubject framed from chest up, standing in active rainfall. Hair is drenched and clings to forehead and temples. Clothing is soaked and sticks to the skin with visible folds and water gloss. Fabric appears semi-transparent in places due to saturation. Droplets stream down face and collarbones. Skin surface glistens under backlighting from moisture. No dry areas — the subject has been under rain for an extended period.\n\nDramatic cinematic night portrait under rainfall. High-contrast backlighting with cool-toned rim lights and faint lens flare. Shot wide open at f/1.4 on a full-frame camera to capture shallow depth of field and isolate the subject against blurred droplets and fog. Strong directional lighting from behind creates glowing highlights and wet reflections. Cool blue and steel grey color grading, inspired by neo-noir film lighting. Moisture particles and mist illuminated by light spill.\n\nDark and minimal background obscured by heavy rain and fog. No visible structures; environment fades into a cinematic blue-grey haze. Twin backlights diffuse through mist and water droplets, forming glowing cones of light and shallow atmospheric depth. Rainfall appears in sharp foreground streaks and softer distant mist, contributing to an immersive night-time ambience.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#2a363b",
      "bgcolor": "#3f5159"
